        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ತಿಂಡಿ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತಿಂಡಿ (tiṇḍi) — \"a snack, a light meal\", also the word for breakfast. It comes from ತಿನ್ನು (tinnu), \"to eat\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ತಿಂಡಿ ಆಯ್ತಾ? (tiṇḍi āytā?) — \"have you had breakfast?\""
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Something to eat, from the verb to eat."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
